moncroc000","body":"Yesss. I loved the original, and this looks just as good, if not better.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI agree with Rapturous that it'll probably play nearly identical to the original despite some new areas, but honestly I'm fine with that.","body_tagged":"Yesss. I loved the original, and this looks just as good, if not better.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eI agree with Rapturous that it'll probably play nearly identical to the original despite some new areas, but honestly I'm fine with that.","created_at":1430953468},{"id":187210,"author":"LeCobalt","body":"Nice:D","body_tagged":"Nice:D","created_at":1430953902},{"id":187233,"author":"ProfessorUtonium","body":"i already lost","body_tagged":"i already lost","created_at":1430955440},{"id":187292,"author":"Hacktivism","body":"Same.","body_tagged":"Same.","created_at":1430964654,"reply_to":187233},{"id":188904,"author":"Arigenn","body":"\u003cspan\u003eCongratulations! The judges of the map building competition have decided to accept your map, and it may appear in rotations.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAesthetics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;-\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u0026nbsp;3/5\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGameplay -\u003c/strong\u003e 3/\u003c/i\u003e\u003ci\u003e5\u003c/i\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreativity -\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u0026nbsp;3\u003ci\u003e/\u003c/i\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ci\u003e5\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003eThank you for submitting your map! I hope you participate in our next building competition!\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan\u003eCongratulations! The judges of the map building competition have decided to accept your map, and i